{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the squares of the first n positive integers is given by the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/673120794dfce967448dbc682a2920bc2175c06e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n + c)(2n + k)}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" />, \nif <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> are, respectively: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18be4baef5e153891995c4be3b72edd93544175f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ {1}\\text{ and }{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ {3}\\text{ and }{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ {2}\\text{ and }{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ {1}\\text{ and }{1}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ {2}\\text{ and }{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"582\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, the value of the given expression must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4215c50c3e48737000cc4b9230577fda74d20c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />. Plugging in the values given by the answer choices, we see that the only option that returns <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/3/df30be2f01ca4565f54ee4694a684d8b1aaec1fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }1 \\text{ and } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"105\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">